<PageLayout
  title="About StackedTools"
  description="Discover our mission, editorial standards, and the team behind StackedTools.online."
>
  <h2>Our Mission</h2>
  <p>
    StackedTools was built with a simple goal: to help modern professionals, creators, and teams find, compare, and master the best digital software without the marketing fluff.
  </p>
  <p>
    In a sea of generic reviews and sponsored content, we prioritize objective testing, real data, clear comparison tables, and actionable verdicts so you can make informed decisions fast.
  </p>

  <h2>Editorial Standards & E-E-A-T</h2>
  <p>
    Every piece of content on StackedTools follows rigorous editorial guidelines:
  </p>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>Hands-On Testing:</strong> We evaluate tools based on actual user workflows, feature capabilities, pricing tiers, and practical limitations.</li>
    <li><strong>Unbiased Verdicts:</strong> Our recommendations are never sold to the highest bidder. If a tool has drawbacks, we highlight them clearly.</li>
    <li><strong>Up-to-Date Information:</strong> Digital tools evolve quickly. We review and update our comparison guides regularly to ensure pricing and features remain accurate.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Editorial Team</h2>
  <p>
    Our content is produced by tech enthusiasts and software reviewers committed to clarity and accuracy.
  </p>
  <div class="team-card">
    <h3>Alex Rivera</h3>
    <p class="role">Head of AI & Software Research</p>
    <p>Alex specializes in B2B SaaS workflows, generative AI platforms, and productivity tech. With over 6 years of experience testing digital products, Alex oversees our comparative testing methodology.</p>
  </div>
</PageLayout>

